# Keep vuln "answer keys" and demo material OUT of the deployed image — the app's
# own LFR/SSRF (/api/fetch file://, /api/corefile ../) can read any file it ships
# with, so shipping these hands an attacker the planted-vuln solutions.
SECURITY_DEMO.md
demo/
CLAUDE-SECURITY-*/

# Build hygiene (also shrinks the LFR/source-disclosure surface)
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/
